==Battleground==
*8 [[Gabriel]]s (250%) spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Angelic Gory]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] (100%) spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (250%) spawn, delay 13.33~26.67 seconds<sup>400f~800f</sup>.
**5 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Angelic Sleipnir]]s spawn, delay 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
It's important that your attackers outrange the Sleipnirs, as there are 3 of them in this level.

The Slepnirs only have 372 range, so cats like [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Dragon Cat]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Cat]], and basically any cats that have 400 or more range are safe from them. Spam [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cats]] to stall out the Gories and Gabriels, as well as Slepnir.

